WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
Start in New Sale. Choose Invoice to bill a customer, Quick Sale for immediate payment, or Quote for an estimate.

00:06.500 --> 00:14.417
Quick Sale starts with a walk-in customer. Choose Add Products for Catalog items, or Add Custom Item for a one-time entry.

00:14.417 --> 00:19.500
After a sale, open Sales History to find its invoice or receipt and check the balance.

